  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Dark Fibre Africa Peri-Urban and Rural Fiber Expansion Feasibility Study, through FTI Consulting, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant to Dark Fibre Africa (Pty) Ltd is funding a feasibility study that would assess the economic and technical viability of fiber network expansion in areas with low-to-moderate population density in South Africa. The Study would be competed among U.S. firms on the USTDA website and publicized via beta.Sam.gov, as well as highlighted through the USTDA and Prosper Africa social media and marketing platforms</narrative>
  </description>
